# Moonlight Syndrome (SLPS-01001), the chapter in HENLIN.DAT on disc 1. This chapter's kanji and marks,
# 0x0100-0x01FF (117 codes in that range have no glyph), in the order of the chapter's font on the disc (the
# archive's entry 3); 16-bit codes, high byte first. Goes after tables/human-kana.tbl (the codes every chapter
# shares).
# Read by eye from the font, then checked in this and the other chapters' script words. 102 of the 139 are used by
# this chapter's script.
# Not checked in a scene, since no chapter's script uses the glyph: 0x012B, 0x013C, 0x01F0, 0x01F1, 0x01F2, 0x01F3,
# 0x01F4, 0x01F5, 0x01F6, 0x01F7, 0x01F8, 0x01F9, 0x01FA, 0x01FB, 0x01FC, 0x01FD, 0x01FE, 0x01FF.
